# One +1/+1 counter put on Bot1's Ornithopter (Ozolith's {1}{G}, {T} ability, turn 3) meets two replacement effects at once: Ozolith's "that many plus one" and Innkeeper's Talent's level 3 "twice that many". Bot1, the player whose
# counters they are, chooses the order (CR 616.1): the Talent first, so one becomes two and Ozolith adds one to make three. The Ornithopter already has two counters from the Talent's first combat trigger on turn 1 (one doubled), so it ends with 5.

